    #     are P2's; the gate's binary and hash are this phase's
    #     (records/logs/m2p3-p2/gate.log).
    #  L. Family N is replaced by family S, P2's three refusals each beside its
    #     own control; the unbound-prefix case was P1's first negative log's
    #     and is not repeated.
    #  M. Planning's P2 rulings stand in specs/0018 uncommitted; the entry guard
    #     and the status block allow that path and this phase's logs and
    #     records.
    #
    # Usage: m2p3-p2-negative.sh <phase commit> > <scratch file>; the caller moves
    # the output to records/logs/m2p3-p2/negative.log.
